The '''Fisherman's Hut''' is a hut located within the {{zone|Fishing Outpost}}.

{{ZoneText|Learn about the &aSea Creature Guide &ffrom &bGavin&f.|Use the &6Ship Navigator &fto reach the &2Backwater Bayou&f!}}

== Features ==
The '''Fisherman's Hut''' is home to {{NPCSprite|Gavin}}, who talks about the [[Sea Creature Guide]]. {{NPCSprite|Captain Baha}} is also located behind the Fisherman's Hut who helps the player to travel to the {{Zone|Backwater Bayou}}.

